          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લપસવું — lapasvũ — \"to slip\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વરસાદમાં મીરા પગથિયાં પર લપસી ગઈ. varsādmā̃ Mīrā pagthiyā̃ par lapsī gaī. In the rain Mira slipped on the steps."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (she …): તે લપસી ગઈ, te lapsī gaī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લપસવું (lapasvũ) No dictionary we use records an older form, so its history is not settled. A wet floor makes you લપસી જવું: ભીની ભોંય પર લપસી ગઈ, she slipped on the wet floor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
