              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉઝરડો (ujharḍo) comes from ujjharati, a form CDIAL reconstructs, and CDIAL lists Gujarati ujharṛo, \"a scratch\" (CDIAL 1675). It is skin scraped in a fall: ઘૂંટણ પર ઉઝરડો."
