          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ભાન (bhān) is Sanskrit bhāna, \"appearance, perception\" (Monier-Williams): in Gujarati, being aware of oneself and the world. ભાનમાં આવ્યો, he came round; બેભાન is its opposite."
